{"id":"W1fc9efeff0f354dee555f252","zh":"Morison方程","en":"","name":"Morison方程","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W1fc9efeff0f354dee555f252","text":"Morison方程","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S23f8c530f3496dd0a723","source_id":"P129","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"其中, 针对悬浮隧道波浪荷载的计算研究较广泛,项贻强等[10]结合波浪水质点速度和加速度沿水域深度递减的特点,提出了基于Morison方程分层积分的悬浮隧道波浪力计算方法;SEO 等[11]将线性波浪理论应用于Morison方程,简化分析了水下悬浮隧道在波浪中的动力行为并进行了实验验证。","citations":[{"source_id":"P129","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S9c26ffcd3cea6003965e","source_id":"P129","page":3,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"假设波浪入射方向垂直管段,且悬浮隧道外径与波浪波长比值小于0.2,可忽略波浪绕射的影响,采用Morison方程计算波浪力。","citations":[{"source_id":"P129","page":3,"page_end":4}]}],"sources":{"P129":{"id":"P129","title":"波浪荷载作用下车辆−轨道−悬浮隧道动力响应研究","authors":"徐磊,朱雪燕,赵永胜,王琨,刘鹏飞,曾志平","year":"2024","doi":"10.11817/j.issn.1672-7207.2024.09.029","journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"徐磊等（2024）","overview_slug":"2024-study-on-dynamic-response-of-vehicle-track-submerged-floating-tunnel-under-wave-load"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"将管体波浪力分为拖曳力和惯性力的计算关系。","language":"zh","source_id":"P129","paper_slug":"2024-study-on-dynamic-response-of-vehicle-track-submerged-floating-tunnel-under-wave-load","title":"波浪荷载作用下车辆−轨道−悬浮隧道动力响应研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W2ff9eecc07d04b8dd9ccba5a","name":"Morison equation","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W2ff9eecc07d04b8dd9ccba5a","name":"Morison equation","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W2ff9e